### Active adverts
GET {{url}}/adverts/active

### Active adverts for one placement
GET {{url}}/adverts/active?placement=FRONTPAGE_HEADER

### My adverts as organizer/admin (attendee should not have access)
GET {{url}}/adverts/my-adverts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create advert as organizer/admin (attendee should not have access)
POST {{url}}/adverts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "eventId" : 2,
  "addPlacement" : "FRONTPAGE_HEADER",
  "startDate" : "2026-11-11",
  "endDate" : "2026-12-12"
}

### Get all adverts (admin only)
GET {{url}}/adverts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get advert by id (admin only)
GET {{url}}/adverts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update advert (admin only)
PUT {{url}}/adverts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "eventId" : 1,
  "addPlacement" : "FRONTPAGE_HIGHLIGHT",
  "startDate" : "2026-11-16",
  "endDate" : "2026-12-12"
}

### Delete advert (admin only)
DELETE {{url}}/adverts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}